  "content": "<p>你好！</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">后室<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d;text-decoration:underline\">重制版</span></strong></em></span> 是一款目前尚未完成的 Fabric 恐怖模组，灵感源自流行的</span></span>BACKROOMS<span style=\"color:#fff\"> 恐怖概念！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">该模组添加了新的方块，例如著名的黄色墙纸、后室湿地毯、天花板瓷砖和天花板灯！同时还添加了新工具，如后室剑和斧头！（其他工具尚未发布，实体和杏仁水也在开发中！）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">该模组还添加了一个全新的后室维度！（开发中）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">玩得开心！&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#34495e\">作者：totalyrocky</span></p>",
